{"path":"chrono/year_month_weekday/operator_cmp","title":"std::chrono::operator==(std::chrono::year_month_weekday)","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::chrono::</span>operator==<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">(std::chrono::year_month_weekday)</span>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/chrono/year_month_weekday/operator_cmp","section":"chrono","kind":"page","summary":"Compares the two year_month_weekday values x and y.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/chrono\">&lt;chrono&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">==</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/year_month_weekday\"><span class=\"kw2571\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">year_month_weekday</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> x,<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/year_month_weekday\"><span class=\"kw2571\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">year_month_weekday</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> y <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Compares the two <code>year_month_weekday</code> values <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">x</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">y</span></code>.\n</p><p>The <code>!=</code> operator is <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/default_comparisons#Other_defaulted_comparison_operators\">synthesized</a> from <code>operator==</code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">x.<span class=\"me1\">year</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> y.<span class=\"me1\">year</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> x.<span class=\"me1\">month</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> y.<span class=\"me1\">month</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> x.<span class=\"me1\">weekday_indexed</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> y.<span class=\"me1\">weekday_indexed</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;chrono&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kw1\">using</span> <span class=\"kw1\">namespace</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> ymwdi1<span class=\"br0\">{</span>Wednesday<span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"sy2\">/</span>January<span class=\"sy2\">/</span><span class=\"nu0\">2021</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> year_month_weekday ymwdi2<span class=\"br0\">{</span>year<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">2021</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, month<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, weekday<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">3</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/boolalpha\"><span class=\"kw1781\">std::<span class=\"me2\">boolalpha</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>ymwdi1 <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> ymwdi2<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>true</code></pre> \n</div>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"chrono","title":"Date and time utilities"},{"path":"chrono/year_month_weekday","title":"std::chrono::year_month_weekday"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::chrono::operator==(std::chrono::year_month_weekday)","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++20. Compares the two year_month_weekday values x and y."},{"label":"Return value","note":"x.year() == y.year() && x.month() == y.month() && x.weekday_indexed() == y.weekday_indexed()"},{"label":"Example"}]},"standards":["C++20"],"wordCount":76,"codeBlockCount":2}
